        "merge": "EV_PRODUCT_SPRINT_UNASKED_REWRITE_MERGE"
      },
      "expire_note": "EV_PRODUCT_SPRINT_UNASKED_REWRITE_EXPIRED"
    },
    "en": {
      "title": "EV_PRODUCT_SPRINT_UNASKED_REWRITE_TITLE",
      "body": "{employee} rewrote the whole front end without asking anyone. {seam:urun.decision_card} is on track for this release and would take less work on the new code. Nobody has reviewed a line of it. No page looks any different.",
